==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Hyrule Herb}}
Hyrule Herbs can be found growing in the grasslands of [[Hyrule Field]] and the [[Akkala Highlands]]. When eaten raw, they will heal [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]] by one [[Heart]]. [[Meal]]s made using Hyrule Herbs will restore more [[Heart]]s than Meals without.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Hyrule Herbs can be used to make [[Green Dye]].

